@tirupatihemanth 

NTP is getting enabled as server as you are enabling 'dhcp' role in the DPU config which is not default config. Is there any specific reason for adding this?

    "NTP": {
        "global": {
            "admin_state": "enabled",
            "authentication": "disabled",
            **"dhcp": "enabled",**
            "server_role": "disabled",
            "src_intf": "eth0",
            "vrf": "default"
        }
    },
